pr.body:
Generating environment variable names for flags.

```go
type Some {
    Value string
}

cli := struct {
    Some  Some `prefix:"some." embed:""`
}
kong.Parse(root, kong.Env("PREFIX"))
```

Generates:
``    --some.value -> PREFIX_SOME_VALUE
``

